corollary #cor:gaps
  $g(x) \ll x^{1/4} \log x$.

appendix

section A computation #app:comp

lemma #lem:numerics
  For $x \le 10^{12}$ we have $g(x) \le 2 x^{1/4}$; Erdős and Turán knew this,
  see @app:comp.

